  "sourceTitle": "Creamy Pumpkin Spread",
  "sourceText": "Creamy Pumpkin Spread\nBy: Stacey\nPublished: Wednesday, October 6, 2010 - 6:43am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\nCream Together:\n2 cups powdered sugar\n8 ounces packages cream cheese\nBlend:\n30 oz. can pumpkin puree\n2 teaspoons cinnamon\n1 teaspoon ginger\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix: The above two mixtures together. 2 Serve w/ ginger snap cookies, vanilla wafers of Big Soft Ginger Cookies. This spread is also delicious on bagels or toast.\n\nAbout\n\n\nI use this Fall treat on Ginger Snaps and Vanilla wafers.",
